{"id":"wb-7-1150","name":"周公庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-09T06:20:01+00:00","status":"ready","title":"曲阜周公庙","text":"曲阜周公庙，位于山东省曲阜市市区东北，是一座纪念西周政治家、周武王之弟周公的庙宇，作为诸侯国鲁国的祖庙，周公庙是曲阜鲁国故城的中心。周公庙亦称“元圣庙”，因周公曾被封为“元圣”。2013年3月5日，被列为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%9B%B2%E9%98%9C%E5%91%A8%E5%85%AC%E5%BA%99","revisionId":92092580,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92092580","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/444212f1174848ab6aa3e76a.jpg","title":"The Temple of Duke Zhou.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:The_Temple_of_Duke_Zhou.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/ba/The_Temple_of_Duke_Zhou.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"kanegen","license":"CC BY 2.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0","caption":"​山东曲阜周公庙棂星门","width":320,"height":213,"matchEvidence":"名称及地点核对一致","subject":"曲阜周公庙棂星门"}}